1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,408
Associated Press reports that China has rejected Western claims that its factories produce too much.

2
00:00:07,358 --> 00:00:16,020
Beijing says the criticism is unfair as the United States prepares findings from a trade probe that could bring new tariffs.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:25,417
The dispute affects autos, solar panels, steel and other industries, and it may add more tension to China-Europe-US trade.

